\opportunityusecase{Joule for developers, ABAP AI features (SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition)}{Cross-Industry}{Information Technology}{Joule is an AI copilot for ABAP developers, trained on SAP data and processes. Integrated into ABAP Development Tools for Eclipse, it offers real-time explanations of development objects, predicts code based on ABAPDoc, comments, or typed code, and can generate end-to-end ABAP Cloud development scenarios that respect the specific ABAP language version.
ewline  enefits{ Boost developer productivity  
ewline Simplify everyday work and support clean core implementations  
ewline Reduce development cost and shorten time to market  } 
ewline  usinessvalue{ egin{itemize} \item 20 % faster code authoring   \item 25 % faster testing   \item  6.6 % quicker realization of value  \end{itemize}}}
